       fhir:definition [ fhir:v "Connection details of a virtual service (e.g. shared conference call facility with dedicated number/details)." ] ;
       fhir:comment [ fhir:v "There are two types of virtual meetings that often exist:\r\r* a persistent, virtual meeting room that can only be used for a single purpose at a time,\r * and a dynamic virtual meeting room that is generated on demand for a specific purpose.\r\r Implementers may consider using Appointment.virtualService for virtual meeting rooms that are generated on-demand." ] ;
